                <pb facs="0835" n="723" sameAs="frus:frus1910/pg723"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 212.11G/6.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador Wilson to the Secretary of
                    State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1910-04-29"><hi rendition="#italic">April 29,
                                1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Reports that the foreign office in a note received to-day, advises him that
                    Heliodoro Garcia has been arrested. Adds that detention dates from the 23d
                    instant.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
